DESCRIPTION >
    Super-admin site inspector: 50 most recent events (any type) with
    page_url, used to derive install status, pageview/conversion presence,
    and domain. Tenant-scoped; prunes via (site_id, timestamp). Faithful 1:1
    port of api/routes/admin.js:428-434 (queryName 'admin_site_detail').
    Typed-column translation (SCOPE_v3.md §2.6): properties.site_id ->
    site_id, event -> event_type, properties.page_url -> page_url (typed,
    String Nullable per §2.6). Source has NO event_type filter (matches any
    event) — preserved exactly. LIMIT 50 (not LIMIT 1 — the caller scans rows
    for $pageview/$conversion presence), distinct from the LIMIT-1
    admin_preview_install/admin_preview_overview shape despite the similar
    SELECT list — not a duplicate. No JSON-bag fields.
    NOT YET PUSHED — validated read-only via `tb --cloud sql` only.

TOKEN "st_endpoint_read" READ

NODE admin_site_detail_node
SQL >
    %
    SELECT event_type, timestamp, page_url
    FROM events
    WHERE site_id = {{ String(site_id, required=True) }}
    ORDER BY timestamp DESC
    LIMIT 50

TYPE endpoint
